  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@pla_is_me\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dxehc2hn3/image/upload/v1761811663/youtube_icon_bcbanf.png\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\"></a> &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fEsvPsnqJpz\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dxehc2hn3/image/upload/v1761811736/discord_icon_bg_rp4omx.png\" alt=\"Discord\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\"></a> &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fpla_is_me\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dxehc2hn3/image/upload/v1761815764/kofi_icon_bg_sy3foi.png\" alt=\"Ko‑fi\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\"></a> &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"https://github.com/PlaIsMe\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dxehc2hn3/image/upload/v1761811682/github_icon_bg_wmtjei.png\" alt=\"Github\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\"></a></p>\n<p><strong>Annoying Villagers：玩家 NPC 武器擴充</strong> 是一個附加模組，當來自 Annoying Villagers 模組的玩家 NPC 生成時，會為他們新增更多武器。</p>\n<p style=\"color:#fc0;font-size:22px;font-weight:bold;text-align:center\">⚠️ 歡迎推薦其他模組加入此模組。<br>但武器需維持平衡，且能使用鐵或鑽石合成，不應來自 Boss 戰。</p>\n<p><strong>相容模組列表：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dungeons-and-combat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>地牢與戰鬥</strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-mod-rapier-moveset-addon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Epic Fight：刺劍招式擴充包</strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-knights-armor-and-weapons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Epic Knights：盾牌、護甲與武器</strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epicfight-resurrection\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EpicFight：復活</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/samurai-dynasty\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">武士王朝</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simply-swords\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">簡易劍刃</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spartan-weaponry\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">斯巴達武裝</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/weapons-of-miracles-epicfight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">奇蹟武器</a></li>\n</ul>",
